"""Agent Monitor — live view of the AI agent's activity on this VM.

Harness:
    ~/.agent-auto-log  (BASH_ENV DEBUG-trap hook)
      -> ~/.agent-monitor/logs/commands-YYYY-MM-DD.log  (daily rotation)
      -> this app: classifies each command as READ or WRITE, drives the
         AI <-> VM arrows + counters, shows the raw log (search/clear),
         and manages the Cloudflare tunnel (status, restart/stop/start,
         ingress settings with add/remove hostnames).

CLI:
    agent-monitor                  open the GUI
    agent-monitor --stats          print today's read/write totals
    agent-monitor --selftest       verify classifier + parsers, exit 0/1
    agent-monitor --version
    agent-monitor --screenshot F   (internal) render window, save PNG, quit
"""

